					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE: SINE TO BOX\n\nIn this example we're converting a Sine oscillator to a Float 2 signal, before using it to construct a Box2D.\nBy sending the box to the Rectangle's UV inlets we can create repeat effects that scale smoothly."
					}
				},
