					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE: REPEATING A PATTERN\n\nIn this example we're using an Int In (renamed to Repeats) to construct our Box2D type.\nThis gets passed on into the Circle geometry.\nNext, we create a material out of a gradient node (note that the wrap mode is set to mirror repeat).\nThis gives us our own custom made repeating pattern."
					}
